WEBVTT

00:02.567 --> 00:06.767
Speech engines mishear names and technical words.

00:07.533 --> 00:15.667
After the meeting, the AI compares the transcript with your agenda, documents and people.

00:16.433 --> 00:24.500
It lists the probable mistakes. Accept them with one click, for this meeting, or always.

00:25.267 --> 00:30.767
Your corrections table keeps them, so the next meeting gets them right.
